":\"text\",\"value\":\"女主角神情紧张地望向画外，风吹动她的头发，背景是模糊的城市废墟与破碎的元素，暗示局势已经“失控”。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"3秒\"}},{\"c_1\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"03\"},\"c_3\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"快速平移跟拍接急推\"},\"c_2\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"远景/大特写切换\"},\"c_5\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"直升机螺旋桨巨大的轰鸣声，引擎咆哮与轮胎尖叫声交织。\"},\"c_4\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"公路上跑车极速狂飙，一架直升机在后方紧追不舍。画面瞬间切至跑车轮胎与地面的剧烈摩擦特写（参考图1海报下半部分）。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"4秒\"}},{\"c_1\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"04\"},\"c_3\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"环绕慢镜头 (Bullet Time)\"},\"c_2\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"侧面特写\"},\"c_5\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"周围环境音瞬间抽离（静音），只保留一声清脆的子弹上膛声。\"},\"c_4\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"画面转为高对比度质感。年轻特工（Agente X）身穿黑皮衣，单手持枪贴近脸颊。一抹鲜红色的光影从他冷峻的侧脸划过。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"3秒\"}},{\"c_1\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"05\"},\"c_3\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"快速剪辑/蒙太奇\"},\"c_2\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"全景\"},\"c_5\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"密集的战术靴脚步声、对讲机急促的英文指令（Go! Go! Go!）。\"},\"c_4\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"画面被强烈的红色笔刷拉丝特效分割（参考图2设计）。红色区域内闪现战术小队持枪突入、破门而入的剪影画面。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"2秒\"}},{\"c_1\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"06\"},\"c_3\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"动感跟拍\"},\"c_2\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"中景\"},\"c_5\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"拳肉相交的沉闷打击声，伴随高燃的电子重金属节拍。\"},\"c_4\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"同样在红黑高反差的拉丝特效背景中，展现激烈的近身肉搏。特工腾空跃起，一记凌厉的飞踢击退敌人，动作干净利落。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"3秒\"}},{\"c_1\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"07\"},\"c_3\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"急速拉远后定格\"},\"c_2\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"中近景\"},\"c_5\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"子弹划破空气的尖啸声（嗖嗖声），最后以一声巨大的电影砸音（Boom）收尾。\"},\"c_4\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"特工背对镜头半转身，持枪处于警戒状态。无数颗子弹带着红色尾迹从他身旁擦过。画面定格，打出粗体做旧标题文字“失控：特工 X (AGENTE X)”。\"},\"c_6\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"4秒\"}}],\"columns\":[{\"field\":\"c_1\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"镜头号\"},{\"field\":\"c_2\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"景别\"},{\"field\":\"c_3\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"运镜\"},{\"field\":\"c_4\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"画面描述\"},{\"field\":\"c_5\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"音效设计\"},{\"field\":\"c_6\",\"width\":200,\"title\":\"时长\"}],\"rowsHeight\":[200,200,200,200,200,200,200]},\"taskInfo\":{\"status\":\"success\",\"taskId\":\"1781062187.7979624e8149cca8e6143b78e29a4650eff7906\"},\"time\":\"1781062142509\",\"title\":\"智能分镜脚本\",\"value\":\"\"},\"id\":\"a6b3705d-0e33-4a0c-8d3f-0643a20edd1a\",\"position\":{\"x\":3379.193504555295,\"y\":2074.18949931516},\"type\":\"storyboardTool\"},{\"data\":{\"params\":{\"gen_count\":1,\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"model\":\"gpt-image-2\",\"prompt\":\"\",\"resolution\":\"1K\",\"quality\":\"high\"},\"product\":[],\"taskInfo\":{\"status\":\"success\"},\"time\":\"1781259593326\",\"title\":\"图片\",\"value\":\"\"},\"id\":\"e4b7603e-537d-4aa4-bd41-557a74de9bda\",\"position\":{\"x\":-1707.3311616957965,\"y\":3508.6474638672635},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"data\":{\"params\":{\"gen_count\":1,\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"model\":\"gpt-image-2\",\"prompt\":\"\",\"resolution\":\"1K\",\"quality\":\"high\"},\"product\":[],\"taskInfo\":{\"status\":\"success\"},\"time\":\"1781259594646\",\"title\":\"图片\",\"value\":\"\"},\"id\":\"5ffae3b1-d325-4376-bebf-6e61289edbab\",\"position\":{\"x\":-370.6347069088064,\"y\":3734.0742415151644},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"data\":{\"params\":{\"gen_count\":1,\"duration\":5,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"seniorParams\":{},\"model\":\"seedance-2.0\",\"modelType\":\"text_to_video\",\"prompt\":\"\",\"resolution\":\"720p\"},\"product\":[],\"taskInfo\":{\"status\":\"success\"},\"time\":\"1781515409791\",\"title\":\"视频\",\"value\":\"https://game-ai-editor-videoassets-test.oss-cn-guangzhou.aliyuncs.com/user_in/20b80b7d-6a56-43a8-8045-d4027ab78169.mp4\"},\"id\":\"f1a03191-8a93-4cc0-ae9f-48d610ed3b19\",\"measured\":{\"width\":400,\"height\":225},\"position\":{\"x\":817.5549036105992,\"y\":3332.40844040